#. …そこは女子トイレよ？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...You do realize that's the girls bathroom?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたが私に何を期待してるのか知らないけど、
#. それには応えられないわ…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't know what you're thinking, but I don't think\n"
"I'll be able to meet your expectations..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは、ボクの部屋だ。
#. いまは戻る必要はないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is my room. I can't head back yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私の部屋を調べてどうするの…？
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Is there some reason you would need to search my\n"
"room...?"
msgstr ""

#. 他を探しましょう。
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Come on, we need to keep looking."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
